      "y>3"
    ],
    "solution": [
      [
        "1/6",
        "To solve for a variable, use inverse operations to undo the operations in the inequality.\nBe sure to do the same operation to both sides of the inequality."
      ],
      [
        "2/6",
        "Solve. \n$2y + 4 > 10$"
      ],
      [
        "3/6",
        "$2y + 4 - 4 > 10 - 4$ (Subtract 4 from both sides)"
      ],
      [
        "4/6",
        "$2y > 6$ (Simplify)"
      ],
      [
        "5/6",
        "$\\frac{2y}{2} > \\frac{6}{2}$ (Divide both sides by 2)"
      ],
      [
        "6/6",
        "$y > 3$ (Simplify)"
      ]
    ]
  },
